  "contentHtml": "<p>질문하는&#160;학교&#160;선도학교&#160;연구·지원센터(2025).&#160;학생&#160;질문&#160;중심의&#160;교과&#160;수업&#160;모델을&#160;참고하여&#160;제작한&#160;6단원(에너지&#160;전환과&#160;보존)&#160;학습지입니다.</p><p>ppt는 현재 제작중에 있으므로 3차시까지만 업로드해놓았습니다. (아래 구글 드라이브 참고)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>ppt는 제작이 완료되는대로 순차적으로 올리도록 하겠습니다!</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JVKZNOHwrMYUDrSyBdHMRWq3VrAE5Lxl?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JVKZNOHwrMYUDrSyBdHMRWq3VrAE5Lxl?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70b75a44db96a6892c089226e9156ee748dae0df?download\" data-file-name=\"6단원 워크북.pdf\" data-file-size=\"512567\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1545%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260818114757&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F70b75a44db96a6892c089226e9156ee748dae0df')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">6단원 워크북</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">500.55KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/13ce27903450bc43468c814e8d3a46a3d9fb56db?download\" data-file-name=\"중3_과학_6단원_질문중심_학습지_9차시(최종).hwp\" data-file-size=\"2947584\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D1545%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260818114757&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F13ce27903450bc43468c814e8d3a46a3d9fb56db')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">중3_과학_6단원_질문중심_학습지_9차시(최종)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.81MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
